  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tGeneral\n\t\tGeneral\n\n### How to pay for Capium using GoCardless or Stripe\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 9 Jul, 2021 at  2:55 PM\n\n\t\tLocation\n\nMy Admin >> My Subscription >> Invoice Summary >> on the invoice that needs to be paid select either 'GC' for GoCardless or 'SP' for Stripe.\n\nVideo Tutorials:\n\nClick here to watch how to set up a payment using GoCardless\nClick here to watch how to set up a payment using Stripe \n\nHelp Guide:\n\nYou can pay for your Capium invoices through a credit or debit card using Stripe payment, alternatively you can set up a Direct Debit using GoCardless.\n\nIf setting up a GoCardless all occurring invoices will be taken automatically by Direct Debit. You will get an email reminder before the payment will be taken.\n\nNavigating to your invoices\n\nTo find the invoices that need to be paid, use the admin button on the top right hand side of your screen to go into your admin panel.\n\nUsing the navigation tabs on the top of your screen, go to 'My Subscription'.\n\nGo into either 'Invoice Summary' or 'Other Invoices' to see all of your outstanding invoices.\n\nPayments using GoCardless\n\nClick on the 'GC' button to bring up the payment page.\n\nPut in your bank information and click on 'Set up Direct Debit' to make the payment.\n\nPayments using Stripe \n\nClick on the 'SP' button to bring up the payment page.\n\nEnter your bank details and click on 'Confirm & Pay' to make the payment.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000092543\">General</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000189872\">General</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How to pay for Capium using GoCardless or Stripe\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Fri, 9 Jul, 2021 at  2:55 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\"><u>Location</u></strong><br><br>My Admin &gt;&gt; My Subscription &gt;&gt; Invoice Summary &gt;&gt; on the invoice that needs to be paid select either 'GC' for GoCardless or 'SP' for Stripe.<br><br><strong dir=\"ltr\"><u>Video Tutorials:</u></strong><br><br><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/37e0dda467ae46709598a94f86025189\" target=\"_self\">Click here to watch how to set up a payment using GoCardless</a><br><a href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/f50a339b61724237ab41ca946f073382\">Click here to watch how to set up a payment using Stripe </a></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\"><u dir=\"ltr\">Help Guide:</u></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">You can pay for your Capium invoices through a credit or debit card using Stripe payment, alternatively you can set up a Direct Debit using GoCardless.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">If setting up a GoCardless all occurring invoices will be taken automatically by Direct Debit. You will get an email reminder before the payment will be taken.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><u>Navigating to your invoices</u></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">To find the invoices that need to be paid, use the admin button on the top right hand side of your screen to go into your admin panel.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9133883425/original/AxWcwAD88d1LyzpxEL8jdaYj2c_K0z79RA.png?1625577707\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9133883425\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Using the navigation tabs on the top of your screen, go to 'My Subscription'.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9133884592/original/dYIN2Dbv3226n55ODWxqnyNHAa_iRHFmQQ.png?1625578218\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9133884592\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Go into either 'Invoice Summary' or 'Other Invoices' to see all of your outstanding invoices.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9133884857/original/z0juz_CX0wJPo0l2isc01uYBmUGthVYQVw.png?1625578348\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9133884857\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><u dir=\"ltr\">Payments using GoCardless</u></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Click on the 'GC' button to bring up the payment page.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9133885257/original/yvXpxosct_UcEuKUt5WmrSUV32k8wGdK7Q.png?1625578571\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9133885257\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Put in your bank information and click on 'Set up Direct Debit' to make the payment.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9133886121/original/Rvg59m5nK7vstqT6sK4uJQJQrH2ML0k6eA.png?1625578984\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9133886121\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><u dir=\"ltr\">Payments using Stripe </u></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><u><br></u></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style='color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;'>Click on the 'SP' button to bring up the payment page.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><u dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9133886446/original/sVbG0yg3lWZMIfow-31QoMwr-6LoNKi3sQ.png?1625579141\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9133886446\"></u></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style='color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;'>Enter your bank details and click on 'Confirm &amp; Pay' to make the payment.</span></p><p><u dir=\"ltr\"><br></u></p><p><u dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9133892769/original/ReCS5_zQejLCnbEsuk0oy16Oa1Ssrb1k2A.png?1625582187\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9133892769\"></u></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000204164\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000204164/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000204164\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000204164/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000204164\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span></span></p><a class=\"hide a-link\" id=\"vote-feedback-form-link\" data-hide-dom=\"#vote-feedback-form-link\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">Send feedback</a><div id=\"vote-feedback-container\"class=\"hide\">\t